  --> tests/ui/scalar_decrypt_target_requires_zeroize.rs:11:30
   |
11 |     let _ = keyset.decrypt::<Email>(ciphertext.clone());
   |                              ^^^^^ one `Ciphertext` decrypts into one owned value
